entries.testAndInterview:
There is no written test - instead, a time-bound deck-preparation round (only a couple 
of days given). 4 interview rounds, all online: Round 1 - resume and deck-based; 
Round 2 - problem-solving (mostly root-cause-analysis style); Round 3 - with the CTO; 


196 
Round 4 - with the founder. The later rounds lean more HR/discussion-style, focused 
on your product-space experience so far.

